  "narrative": {
    "intro": "Caddell Construction Co de reported $561M in federal contract obligations in FY2026 to date. Caddell Construction Co de won 21 awards so far in the fiscal year, with an average award size of $26.7M, and obligations are up 162.7% year over year. Caddell Construction Co de’s FY2026 total is concentrated with the Department of State, which obligated $561M for the vendor this fiscal year, while the Department of Defense obligated $153K. Caddell Construction Co de’s recent fiscal history shows a swing across years: FY21 at $231M, FY22 at $2.2B, FY23 at $31.1M, FY24 at $979M, FY25 at $214M, and FY26 at $561M. Caddell Construction Co de’s current-year totals are partial because the fiscal year is still in progress, and the page note clarifies that all figures are contract obligations except award-value figures in the largest-awards and expiring-contracts tables, which are total contract values. Use these figures to compare buying agencies, award counts, and year-to-year variability for procurement planning and partner outreach.",
